OL,3,APorridge makers from opposite sides of
OL,4,Aglobe triumph in world championship
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo national porridge-making champions
OL,7,Ffrom almost opposite sides of the
OL,8,Fplanet have triumphed in the annual
OL,9,Fworld championships held in the
OL,10,FScottish Highlands.
OL,12,FGina Saarberg, 28, took the coveted
OL,13,FGolden Spurtle using the same recipe
OL,14,Fthat saw her crowned Dutch champion in
OL,15,FJuly, using organic pinhead oats, salt
OL,16,Fand water that she brought with her
OL,17,Ffrom the Netherlands.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
