OL,3,APorridge makers from opposite sides of
OL,4,Aglobe triumph in world championship
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralian champion Rob Reid took the
OL,7,Fspeciality award - where competitors
OL,8,Fcan combine oatmeal with any
OL,9,Fingredients - with his porridge
OL,10,Fcannoli, an oaty spin on a tube-shaped
OL,11,Fdessert that originated in Sicily.
OL,13,FThirty competitors from 14 countries
OL,14,Ftook part in the contest, held each
OL,15,Fyear at Carrbridge, just north of
OL,16,FAviemore.
